<title>USA: Nevada Energy postpones reverse shr split.</title>
<headline>Nevada Energy postpones reverse shr split.</headline>
<dateline>SANTA BARBARA, Calif 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nevada Energy Co said it had postponed a proposed reverse stock split of its common shares.</p>
<p>The company did not give further details.</p>
</text>
